function PricingSettings({settings,onSaved}){const [open,setOpen]=useState(false),[f,setF]=useState(null);useEffect(()=>{if(settings)setF({...settings})},[settings]);if(!f)return null;async function save(){await supabase.from('pricing_settings').update({hourly_rate:Number(f.hourly_rate||0),packaging_cost:Number(f.packaging_cost||0),misc_cost:Number(f.misc_cost||0),marketplace_fee_percent:Number(f.marketplace_fee_percent||0),payment_fee_percent:Number(f.payment_fee_percent||0),fixed_fee:Number(f.fixed_fee||0),target_margin_percent:Number(f.target_margin_percent||0)}).eq('id',f.id);setOpen(false);onSaved()}return <Card><div className="card-head"><div><h2>Pricing assumptions</h2><p>Default labor, packaging, fee and margin assumptions used by the calculator.</p></div><Button variant="secondary" onClick={()=>setOpen(!open)}>{open?'Close':'Edit assumptions'}</Button></div>{open?<><div className="form-grid"><Field label="Hourly labor rate" type="number" step=".01" value={f.hourly_rate} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,hourly_rate:e.target.value}))}/><Field label="Default packaging" type="number" step=".01" value={f.packaging_cost} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,packaging_cost:e.target.value}))}/><Field label="Default misc." type="number" step=".01" value={f.misc_cost} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,misc_cost:e.target.value}))}/><Field label="Marketplace fee %" type="number" step=".01" value={f.marketplace_fee_percent} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,marketplace_fee_percent:e.target.value}))}/><Field label="Payment fee %" type="number" step=".01" value={f.payment_fee_percent} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,payment_fee_percent:e.target.value}))}/><Field label="Fixed fee / sale" type="number" step=".01" value={f.fixed_fee} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,fixed_fee:e.target.value}))}/><Field label="Target margin %" type="number" step=".1" value={f.target_margin_percent} onChange={e=>setF(v=>({...v,target_margin_percent:e.target.value}))}/></div><div className="modal-actions"><Button onClick={save}>Save assumptions</Button></div></>:<div className="assumption-strip"><span>Labor <strong>{'$'}{Number(f.hourly_rate).toFixed(2)}/hr</strong></span><span>Fees <strong>{(Number(f.marketplace_fee_percent)+Number(f.payment_fee_percent)).toFixed(2)}% + {'$'}{Number(f.fixed_fee).toFixed(2)}</strong></span><span>Target margin <strong>{Number(f.target_margin_percent).toFixed(1)}%</strong></span></div>}</Card>}
